[{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0001","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0010","text":"……真乃，会晒黑的\n要不要到阴凉处……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0020","text":"……啊……\n嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0030","text":"发现什么了吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0040","text":"……蓝蓝的天空上\n飘着蓬松的积雨云……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0050","text":"云好大……！\n是夏天呢——\n……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0060","text":"嗯……\n看起来好舒服……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0061","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0070","text":"……能不能跟云一起拍张照呢"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0080","text":"试试看？\n积雨云，和我们……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0090","text":"……嗯……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s20_30200400_02_0100","text":"嗯，角度是…………啊，能再靠近一点吗？\n……嗯，感觉不错。那就──……"}]
